meta {
  name: Delete DataSink
  type: http
  seq: 7
}

delete {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/datasets/:dataSetId/datasinks/:id
  body: none
  auth: inherit
}

params:path {
  dataSetId: {{dataSetId}}
  id: {{dataSinkId}}
}

docs {
  **Precondition:** `dataSetId` and `dataSinkId` are set. The DataSink must not be in use by a Layer (delete dependent Layers first).

  **Expected Response:** 204 No Content.

  **Verification:** Issue `get-datasink-by-id` for the same `dataSinkId` and confirm 404.

  **System Impact:**

  | Layer | Effect |
  |---|---|
  | Backend | DataSink record removed |
  | Config Adapter | — |
  | External System | — |
}
